SPARKMLKEM
==========

SPARKMLKEM is a derivative of the SPARK/Ada ML-KEM (FIPS 203) implementation
in LibFormalPQC (formerly LibMLKEM), written by Rod Chapman and the AWS Labs
team at Amazon Web Services, and published under the Apache License 2.0 at
https://github.com/awslabs/LibFormalPQC. The algorithm structure, the field
arithmetic, the type design and the SPARK proofs of this crate are theirs.
The changes made for the SPARKTLS project are listed in CHANGES_FROM_UPSTREAM.md
and marked in the source headers of every modified file, as the Apache License
2.0 section 4(b) requires.

